(4)
The functions of the State Lending Library Section shall be as follows:-
(a)
to render home-lending service;
(b)
to replenish from time to time the stocks of district libraries;
(c)
to give book service to Cultural and Educational Institutions and Social Welfare Organisation;
(d)
to arrange book-exhibitions and book display on suitable occasions;
(e)
to publicise its book-stock and to arrange for extension service;
(f)
to publish library reports and literature.
